<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Sept 3.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Sept 3.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Oct/Dec 139.00</p>
<p>Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Oct 133.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Nov/Dec 112.00</p>
<p>Southampton Spot 109.00</p>
<p>East Anglia Spot 109.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Sep 107.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Sep 107.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Oct/Dec 107.50</p>
<p>Avon range Sep 102.00</p>
<p>Hampshire Sep 102.00</p>
